            {
                "comment": "Jonathan was very engaging and his assignments were always clear and fun! He mentioned assigning more work than other english 100 professors but I thought the workload was very appropriate, especially with his scheduling and overall organization of the class. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
